  <h2>Avoid Greenwashing</h2>
  <p>Australian customers are increasingly skeptical of vague eco claims. Before launching sustainable activewear, confirm the fiber composition, supplier documents, care label wording, and packaging details. Avoid claims that cannot be supported by the material or supply chain.</p>

  <h2>How Fitclo Supports Sustainable Private Label</h2>
  <p>Fitclo helps Australian brands select sustainable activewear options based on product category, MOQ, price target, fabric hand feel, and brand positioning. You can start with a simple recycled-fabric capsule, then expand into more advanced custom fabric development after repeat demand is proven.</p>
